        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Carlo Pedersoli\n- Films: Troublemakers (1994 film)\n- Roles: director, actor, professional swimmer, water polo player\n\nFacts:\n- Carlo Pedersoli was born on 31 October 1929 and died on 27 June 2016.\n- Carlo Pedersoli was professionally known as Bud Spencer.\n- Bud Spencer was an Italian actor, professional swimmer, and water polo player.\n- Troublemakers is a 1994 film.\n- Troublemakers was the last pairing of Terence Hill and Bud Spencer.\n- Terence Hill also directed Troublemakers.",
